{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "HNN Biller \u2014 Master Control API (SaaS owner)",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Manage every organisation on the deployment \u2014 clients, payers, EMR/EHR partners \u2014 the IT leads assigned to them, and each client\u2019s edition. **This is the transition API: move any client between commercial and non-commercial instantly, in both directions, with no data loss.**\n\n### Editions\nEvery client runs on one of two editions in the **same deployment**:\n\n| Edition | Includes |\n|---|---|\n| `non_commercial` | Billing, payer routing, patient payments, dashboard, notifications, medical reports |\n| `commercial` | Everything above **plus** revenue rules & other charges, financing, NHIS ClaimIt tracker, agnostic payer tabs, audit ledger |\n\nSwitching is a per-client flag flip \u2014 no redeploy, no data migration, and **nothing is deleted on downgrade**.\nCommercial-only endpoints return **402 `upgrade_required`** when the caller's client is non-commercial.\nCheck your own entitlement any time with `GET /api/v1/bills/edition`.\n\n**Base URL:** `https://nextgenhnnbiller-production.up.railway.app`\n\n_The platform never custodies funds: money moves account-to-account to the provider; fees are accrued to the ledger as receivables._"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://nextgenhnnbiller-production.up.railway.app",
      "description": "Production"
    },
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:3000",
      "description": "Local"
    }
  ],
